## Model card

- **Name:** GLM 5.3 FlashX
- **Short description:** Z.ai’s GLM 5.3 FlashX is described in local metadata as a low-latency serving variant of GLM 5.3 Flash for streaming-heavy coding and multimodal workloads.
- **Provider / access:** Z.ai / Zhipu ecosystem (per local metadata). Local metadata lists `opencode/glm-5.3-flashx`, aliases, and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Release and knowledge cutoff not independently verified from accessible official public sources in this pass.
- **IDs:** `glm-5.3-flashx` (and aliases listed in local metadata).
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 (1M); 128K output (local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video input; text output (local metadata).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.37 / $1.25 per 1M (local metadata); not independently verified from an accessible official pricing page in this pass.
- **Architecture:** Described in local metadata as 320B/18B FlashX serving variant (same weights as Flash); not independently verified in this pass.

